  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "tui_note",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 650,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "The SERVER never runs your shell.\nA tool call becomes a job sent over the\nsocket to a terminal on the named\ndevice. That terminal runs it and sends\nback act 'out'. No terminal open on\nthat device = the tool cannot run.",
