  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "disk_note",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 940,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 135,
   "text": "main/ and tree/ are append-only. A\n'compaction' only ADDS a summary line\nto tree/; no message is replaced. So the\nagent can always zoom back to the\noriginal. (view.json is overwritten.)\nBack users/local/ up.",
   "originalText": "main/ and tree/ are append-only. A\n'compaction' only ADDS a summary line\nto tree/; no message is replaced. So the\nagent can always zoom back to the\noriginal. (view.json is overwritten.)\nBack users/local/ up.",
